---
layout: layout.njk
---

{% set elephantClass = "w-full h-auto" %}

<div class="min-h-screen bg-base-100 text-base-content">
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-8 md:gap-12 mb-8">
        <div class="text-pink-400 w-16 md:w-20">
          {% include "elephant.njk" %}
        </div>
        <div class="text-gray-300 w-16 md:w-20">
          {% include "elephant.njk" %}
        </div>
        <div class="text-yellow-300 w-16 md:w-20">
          {% include "elephant.njk" %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight mb-6">
        There are three elephants in every meeting room.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg opacity-80 mb-3 leading-relaxed">
        The brains in the room. The bureaucracy they work within. The culture they create together.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg opacity-80 leading-relaxed">
        Every organizational problem is shaped by all three.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THREE ELEPHANTS DETAILED -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-accent">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="space-y-12">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-brain text-pink-400 text-2xl"></i>
            Brain
          </h2>
          <ul class="opacity-90 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
            <li>Habits and mental shortcuts</li>
            <li>Cognitive load</li>
            <li>Energy-efficient thinking</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines text-gray-300 text-2xl"></i>
            Bureaucracy
          </h2>
          <ul class="opacity-90 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
            <li>Rules and processes</li>
            <li>Decision rights</li>
            <li>Incentives</li>
            <li>Organizational structures</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-users text-yellow-300 text-2xl"></i>
            Culture
          </h2>
          <ul class="opacity-90 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
            <li>Trust</li>
            <li>Psychological safety</li>
            <li>Unwritten rules</li>
            <li>Shared assumptions</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW I WORK -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-2">How I work</h2>
      <p class="opacity-80 mb-10 text-lg">My approach is guided by three principles:</p>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
          <div class="text-primary text-xl w-8 flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-brain"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Brain Budget</h3>
            <p class="opacity-80">People have limited attention and cognitive capacity. Most dysfunction makes sense once you see it as energy efficiency in disguise.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
          <div class="text-primary text-xl w-8 flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-minus"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Via Negativa</h3>
            <p class="opacity-80">Removing obstacles is often more effective than adding solutions. Subtract before you add.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
          <div class="text-primary text-xl w-8 flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-question"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Humble Consulting</h3>
            <p class="opacity-80">Sustainable change comes from understanding together, not prescribing from the outside.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROOF -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-accent">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <p class="text-lg italic opacity-90 leading-relaxed">Man merkt, dass Nicolas über langjährige Erfahrung im Team-Coaching verfügt. Dadurch war er in der Lage in kurzer Zeit ein sehr gutes Gefühl für die relevanten Themen zu bekommen, an welchen für die Weiterentwicklung unseres neu formierten Teams gearbeitet werden musste.</p>
        <footer class="mt-2 text-sm opacity-60">— André, Führungskraft</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FREE RESOURCES -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6">
        <div class="w-10">{% include "elephant.njk" %}</div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4 text-center">Free resources</h2>
      <p class="text-lg opacity-80 mb-8 text-center max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Not ready to talk? Start with the DIY Team Building Game — a year of team development challenges, free and no facilitator required.
      </p>
      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="/resources/" class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline">
          Browse all resources →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONSULTING -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-accent">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-8">Organizations often misdiagnose their problems.</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center mb-10">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p class="text-lg opacity-90 leading-relaxed">
            A culture initiative tries to solve a bureaucratic constraint.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg opacity-90 leading-relaxed">
            A new process attempts to fix a cognitive overload problem.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg opacity-90 leading-relaxed">
            My role is to identify which elephant is actually driving the situation — and how the others reinforce it.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-4">
            <a href="/consulting/" class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline">More about my approach →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <img src="/assets/images/GraphicRecording.jpeg" alt="Graphic recording session" class="rounded-2xl shadow-sm w-full object-cover" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DIAGNOSTIC CTA -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4">Which elephant is causing your problem?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg opacity-90 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Bring one situation that feels stuck. Together we'll explore whether the real constraint lies in the brains in the room, the bureaucracy around them, the culture between them — or in the interaction of all three.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@organifanten.com" class="btn btn-primary text-lg">
        Let's talk
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "footer.njk" %}

</div>
